    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="55">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 55</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ælðeodige men, gif hig heora hemed rihtan nellað, [driue hi man of] lande mid heora æhtan ⁊ on synnan gewitan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Foreigners, if they will not regularise their unions, shall be driven from the land with their possessions, and shall depart in sin.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ælþeodige men, gif hig heora hæmed rihtan nellan, of lande mid heora æhtum ⁊ synnan gewitan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
